   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">General question: Results related to the intended outcome 2015Question: Summarise results related to the intended outcome (this information will be sent to Open Aid)Answer: The following results, among others, have been achieved:
-Improved framework for sector coordination, including formation of an urban network;
-Improved sector capacity for participatory planning. This includes UN-HBAITAT contribution to Strategic Urban Planning though the Kenya Municipal Program;
-Establishment of a semi-aerobic sanitary landfill, and;
-Improvement by nearly 100% of revenue generated by Kiambu county. 
For all the results UN-HABITAT has developed an approach for dissemination to all counties.</narrative>
